lineBuf         BYTE    0[LINE_BUF_SIZE]
lineLen         LONG    0

DAT { watchdog heartbeat contract, task 3534 -- DAT, not VAR: this is cog-0-owned instrumentation
      state the watchdog cog reads across cog boundaries, grouped with the other cog-0-owned
      mutable instrumentation state above (lineBuf/lineLen) rather than the run-wide VAR blocks
      that carry the scan's own results }

